Implement only indexes justified by access patterns explicitly defined
in DESIGN.md.

This must include the spatial GiST index required for Area geometry.

Review DESIGN.md and identify any additional B-tree indexes required for:

- Workspace membership lookup
- Areas by workspace
- AreaVersion history lookup

Do not add speculative indexes.

Explain each proposed explicit index and the query/access pattern it supports.

